  "description": "Test build of Cassiopeia as in League (needs League of Legends Heroes): replaces the main pack's Cassiopeia so Twin Fang's bonus damage and heal go off on a target that is itself poisoned (the main pack: within 3 seconds of her Q or W poisoning anyone), and Petrifying Gaze petrifies the enemies facing her and slows those turned away (the main pack: the near ones petrified, the far ones slowed); like League's Serpentine Grace she buys no boots (a third-party item mod's boots are dropped from her item build; boots she gets anyway give her nothing - the 4+6 item pack's boots too, whose 6-item routes always hold a pair: their packaged stats come off). Other champions are untouched. Writes a log for testing.",
